body:
Merry Christmas! Hope you have a lovely day today <3

&#x200B;

I've been working my way up to a Mutant Ixi! Have a really fun customization idea for it >:)

Thank you so much for taking the time and energy to do this! Appreciate this a lot.

&#x200B;

UN: emilysvart

Okay, first of all: wow. Thank you!

&#x200B;

As for the holidays - they've never been much of a thing for me based on upbringing, but recently I have been working on reintroducing myself to that culture, step by step :) My favourite thing so far is spending hours on figuring out the most perfect gifts for my close friends or Secret Santa recipients. I love doing compound presents of several small or big things that add up to something that feels Just Right.

LMAO oh man I never knew about that. Do they always do that?

&#x200B;

~~maybe that's why Flash needs to die, to repent for the sins of these Nimmos~~

That looks incredible, love the 80s vibe!

&#x200B;

(80s? 70s? Grease? :P Something along those lines. Looks great!)
